{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0130-surrounded-regions","title":"LeetCode 130 被围绕的区域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0130-surrounded-regions","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-130-被围绕的区域\">LeetCode 130 被围绕的区域</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个 <code>m × n</code> 的矩阵 <code>board</code>，由若干字符 <code>&#39;X&#39;</code> 和 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 组成，找到所有被 <code>&#39;X&#39;</code> 围绕的区域，并将这些区域里所有的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 用 <code>&#39;X&#39;</code> 填充。</p>\n<p>被围绕的区域定义：一个 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 区域如果不与边界上的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 相连（直接或间接），则被视为被围绕。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>m == board.length</code></li>\n<li><code>n == board[i].length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 200</code></li>\n<li><code>board[i][j]</code> 为 <code>&#39;X&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：board = [&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;O&quot;,&quot;O&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;O&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;O&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;]&#10;]&#10;输出：[&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;X&quot;,&quot;O&quot;,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;X&quot;]&#10;]&#10;解释：左下角的 &#39;O&#39; 在边界上，不会被填充。&#10;      其他所有 &#39;O&#39; 都被 &#39;X&#39; 围绕，被填充。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：board = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"O\",\"O\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"X\",\"O\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"O\",\"X\",\"X\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"X\",\"O\",\"X\",\"X\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：左下角的 'O' 在边界上，不会被填充。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      其他所有 'O' 都被 'X' 围绕，被填充。</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题的关键思路是<strong>逆向思维</strong>：不是找被围绕的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code>，而是找<strong>不被围绕的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code></strong>（与边界相连的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code>），剩余的自然就是被围绕的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>逆向思维：从边界出发</strong></p>\n<p>直接判断一个 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 区域是否被完全围绕比较困难。但我们可以反过来：先找到所有与边界相连的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code>（这些不会被填充），标记它们为&quot;安全&quot;，然后将所有未标记的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 填充为 <code>&#39;X&#39;</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>算法步骤：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>遍历矩阵的四条边界，对每个边界上的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 启动 DFS/BFS</li>\n<li>将所有与边界 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 相连的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 标记为临时符号（如 <code>&#39;S&#39;</code>）</li>\n<li>遍历整个矩阵：<ul>\n<li><code>&#39;O&#39;</code> → <code>&#39;X&#39;</code>（被围绕，填充）</li>\n<li><code>&#39;S&#39;</code> → <code>&#39;O&#39;</code>（与边界相连，恢复）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>方法二：并查集</strong></p>\n<p>创建一个虚拟节点代表&quot;边界&quot;。将所有边界上的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 和虚拟节点合并，将相邻的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 合并。最终所有不与虚拟节点连通的 <code>&#39;O&#39;</code> 就是被围绕的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DFS 从边界出发</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>递归栈深度可能较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFS 从边界出发</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>队列空间较小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并查集</td>\n<td>O(m × n × α)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>适合动态连通性查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：DFS 从边界出发（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function solve(board: string[][]): void {&#10;  const m = board.length;&#10;  if (m === 0) return;&#10;  const n = board[0].length;&#10;&#10;  function dfs(row: number, col: number): void {&#10;    if (row &lt; 0 || row &gt;= m || col &lt; 0 || col &gt;= n || board[row][col] !== &#39;O&#39;) {&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    board[row][col] = &#39;S&#39;;&#10;    dfs(row + 1, col);&#10;    dfs(row - 1, col);&#10;    dfs(row, col + 1);&#10;    dfs(row, col - 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {&#10;    dfs(i, 0);&#10;    dfs(i, n - 1);&#10;  }&#10;  for (let j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;    dfs(0, j);&#10;    dfs(m - 1, j);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; m; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;      if (board[i][j] === &#39;O&#39;) {&#10;        board[i][j] = &#39;X&#39;;&#10;      } else if (board[i][j] === &#39;S&#39;) {&#10;        board[i][j] = &#39;O&#39;;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> solve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">board</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> board.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> board[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> board[row][col] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'O'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    board[row][col] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'S'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, col);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row, col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row, col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A